        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana ZA2003/24, ZA Series Modern 24\" Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe modern feel of this Deltana ZA2003/24 towel bar makes it great for any contemporary setting. The contemporary square shape brings interesting design to the lowly towel bar. The 24\" length means that is it large enough to hold more than one towel at a time. Made of zinc and aluminum. This Modern Value series towel bar is made with the excellent quality for which Deltana is known.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-ZA2003_24-specifications.gif?v=1704354506\" width=\"600\" height=\"132\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana ZA2003/24 24\" Towel Bar Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/18-inch-modern-value-towel-bar-deltana-za2002-18\"><b>18\" ZA Series Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/30-inch-modern-value-towel-bar-deltana-za2004-30\"><b>30\" ZA Series Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/24-inch-modern-value-double-towel-bar-deltana-za2006-24\"><b>24\" ZA Series Double Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana ZA Series\"><b>Deltana ZA Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the ZA 24 Inch Towel Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: zinc and aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection from Wall to the Bar: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 1-1/8\" squared</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-ZA2003_24.pdf?v=1704262294\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana ZA2003/24 24\" Towel Bar Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 towel bar, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
